================================================================
 🎮 PIXEL HUD & DIALOGUE UI
 by IndigoLay
================================================================

A cozy pixel-art HUD and dialogue UI resource kit for RPG, farming, and
life-sim games. All art is 100% hand-drawn pixel art - no AI.

It provides 11 types of screen designs to cover the game's conversation
flow and progression: in-game HUD, dialogue box with branching choices,
chat-style history log, quest tracker, pause menu, save/load screen,
four popup types, and a component showcase panel.


----------------------------------------------------------------
 ✨ KEY FEATURES
----------------------------------------------------------------

- 🎨 100 hand-drawn pixel-art sprites
- 🔲 47 core UI elements with 9-slice design - panels, bars, and buttons stretch without distortion
- 🔘 Multi-state artwork supported (Normal / Hover / Selected / Dim)
- 🔤 Includes an English font file perfectly suited for pixel art


