----------------------------------------------------------------
 🛠 GRAPHIC USAGE TIPS
----------------------------------------------------------------

  🎨 EASY COLOR CHANGES
    Most assets are drawn in neutral tones. You can easily change the theme color 
    just by using the color overlay (Tint) feature of your game engine or graphic tool.
    The four progress fill colors are provided as separate sprites.

  📐 FREELY RESIZABLE
    47 core UI elements are designed with 9-slice applied.
    They will not distort at the corners, no matter the resolution or aspect ratio.

  🔘 BUTTON STATE REPLACEMENT
    Buttons and interactive elements include 4 states (Normal / Highlighted / Pressed / Disabled)
    to help you implement perfect visual feedback.

  🔍 PIXEL-PERFECT SCALING
    To maintain the crispness of pixel art, please only scale the images by whole numbers (1x, 2x, 3x...).
    Avoid using fractional scaling.


